OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused 'on some sort of
OL,4,Adrug', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man accused of murdering
OL,7,Fanother man by pushing him into a
OL,8,Fmarina was "on some sort of drug" and
OL,9,Fcalled a friend to buy nitrous oxide on
OL,10,Fthe night of the alleged killing, a
OL,11,Fcourt has heard.
OL,13,FLayton Randle denies murdering Drew
OL,14,FPerham at King Point Marina in Plymouth
OL,15,Fin the early hours of 24 January.
OL,17,FPlymouth Crown Court heard Randle
OL,18,Fadmitted manslaughter and accepted he
OL,19,Fattacked the 24-year-old and caused his
OL,20,Fdeath but did not accept he intended to
OL,21,Fkill Perham or cause him really serious
OL,22,Fharm.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
