OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused 'on some sort of
OL,4,Adrug', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FMohammed Ibrahim said Randle called him
OL,7,Fasking for nitrous oxide less than an
OL,8,Fhour before he saw him start to attack
OL,9,FPerham after they parked up at the
OL,10,Fmarina.
